      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.4</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:32:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.35.1</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>侧边栏数值框改为滑块：显示当前值在范围中的位置，正负范围从中线向两侧填充</li>
